            total_water = W_MAX * waterer[1] - last_eaten
            total_count = ((total_water + count) // 2

    return best(result, ways) * (comb(W_MAX, sleeping + 1) - bisect_right(events, sleeping + 1))   ```

This solution uses dynamic programming with bitmasks to keep track of the sweetness threshold and the number of cows that have eaten their fair share of the grass. It also uses memoization to avoid recalculating the same values and uses the bisect module to count the number of cows that have reached the favorite sweetness.

